<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<!--
  A device pass on somebody's iPhone (app-ios/devicetest/README.md): the Debug
  build installed as `app.getvela.VelaWallet.devicetest`, BESIDE the Vela the
  phone already holds, never over it.

  Deliberately empty, for every target of that build (app, widgets, Safari
  extension, test runners):

  - no associated domains: getvela.app's apple-app-site-association names
    F9W689P9NE.app.getvela.VelaWallet only, so `webcredentials:` could not
    verify for this id anyway — a real passkey ceremony is refused and the
    parallel space signs instead; universal links stay in Safari
    (`VELA_OPEN_LINK` opens one);
  - no app group: `group.app.getvela.VelaWallet` is the store app's, and its
    widget would read this build's balance;
  - so the team's wildcard development profile signs it, and nothing is
    registered on the developer portal.
-->
<dict/>
</plist>
